A.a25=new B.cx("ChatGPT","OpenAI","\ud83d\udcac",A.m,"The AI assistant that made everyone try one.","OpenAI's flagship chat interface. Great at general Q and A, writing help, quick research, and simple coding tasks. Newer versions can browse the web, run code, and read images.","You are a professional who needs a fast second brain for writing, summarising, and light research.","https://chatgpt.com")
A.a2p=new B.cx("Claude","Anthropic","\ud83e\udde0",A.q,"The long-context, careful-reasoning cousin.","Anthropic's assistant, known for handling very long documents, nuanced writing, and thoughtful step-by-step reasoning. Popular in analytical and technical workflows.","You are an analyst or writer who feeds in whole reports or codebases and needs the model to work across all of it.","https://claude.ai")
A.a23=new B.cx("Gemini","Google","\u2728",A.L,"Multimodal AI wired into Google Search + Workspace.","Google's assistant, integrated with Search, Gmail, Docs, and Android. Handles text, images, and voice, and can pull in live search results.","You already live in the Google ecosystem and want AI baked into the tools you already use every day.","https://gemini.google.com")
A.a1W=new B.cx("Perplexity","Perplexity AI","\ud83d\udd0e",A.a6,"AI-powered search with citations on every answer.","A search-first assistant. Every answer links back to the sources it used, which makes it useful when you need to trust \u2014 and check \u2014 what you're being told.","You are a researcher, journalist, or curious person who wants AI answers you can verify at the source.","https://perplexity.ai")
