A.a1J=new B.cx("Grok","xAI","\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f",A.a9U,"A chat model wired into the live feed of X.","xAI's assistant, available inside X (formerly Twitter) with access to real-time posts. Aims for a looser, less-filtered tone than most mainstream assistants.","You are a power user of X who wants an AI that can see what the platform is talking about right now.","https://x.ai")
