A.a2m=new B.cx("GitHub Copilot","GitHub","\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbb",A.q,"Inline AI autocomplete inside your code editor.","Suggests the next line, block, or function as you type. Works inside VS Code, JetBrains IDEs, and more. The tool that made AI-assisted coding mainstream.","You are a developer who wants faster code with fewer trips to the docs, without changing your editor.","https://github.com/features/copilot")
A.a20=new B.cx("Cursor","Anysphere","\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f",A.m,"A code editor rebuilt around AI conversations.","A fork of VS Code with AI baked in at every level \u2014 chat about your codebase, edit multiple files at once, and let the AI run commands in the terminal.","You are a developer who wants AI as a full pair-programmer, not just an autocomplete tool.","https://cursor.sh")
A.a1R=new B.cx("Claude Code","Anthropic","\u2328\ufe0f",A.q,"A terminal-native coding agent from Anthropic.","A command-line AI that reads your code, plans changes, and executes edits in your project. Sits inside your existing terminal instead of replacing your editor.","You are a developer comfortable in the terminal who wants an AI agent to plan and execute multi-file changes.","https://claude.com/product/claude-code")
