A.a2b=new B.cx("Lovable","Lovable","\ud83d\udc96",A.th,"Build full-stack apps from natural language.","Describe the app you want and Lovable scaffolds a full-stack project \u2014 front end, back end, and database \u2014 that you can preview, edit, and deploy from the browser.","You are a founder who needs to prototype a working app in an afternoon, not a sprint.","https://lovable.dev")
