A.a2k=new B.cx("Midjourney","Midjourney","\ud83c\udfa8",A.L,"Highly styled AI image generation.","A community-run image generator known for painterly, cinematic results. Historically ran inside Discord; newer versions have a web app.","You are a designer, marketer, or hobbyist who wants images with a distinctive artistic look.","https://midjourney.com")
