A.luI=new B.r("Wright brothers make the first powered flight",1903,"At Kitty Hawk, Orville flew 120 feet in 12 seconds. The whole first flight was shorter than the wingspan of a modern airliner.")
A.lwO=new B.r("Einstein publishes special relativity and E=mc\xb2",1905,"In his 'miracle year' Einstein showed mass and energy are the same thing. He was a 26-year-old patent clerk at the time.")
A.lBd=new B.r("Rutherford discovers the atomic nucleus",1911,"By firing particles at gold foil, he found atoms are mostly empty space with a tiny dense core. It reshaped all of physics.")
A.lwB=new B.r("Einstein completes his general theory of relativity",1915,"He described gravity as the bending of space and time by mass. It still underpins how we model black holes and the cosmos.")
A.lB5=new B.r("Heisenberg formulates the uncertainty principle",1927,"You cannot know a particle's exact position and speed at once. This idea became a cornerstone of quantum mechanics.")
A.lCw=new B.r("Alexander Fleming discovers penicillin",1928,"He noticed mould killing bacteria in a forgotten petri dish. The first true antibiotic went on to save millions of lives.")
A.lvY=new B.r("Edwin Hubble shows the universe is expanding",1929,"Distant galaxies are racing away from us in every direction. It was the first real evidence for an expanding cosmos.")
A.lwC=new B.r("Clyde Tombaugh discovers Pluto",1930,"A 24-year-old spotted it by comparing photographic plates. It was hailed as the ninth planet for the next 76 years.")
A.lxA=new B.r("James Chadwick discovers the neutron",1932,"Finding the atom's neutral particle completed the nuclear picture. It opened the door to nuclear fission just a few years later.")
A.lyg=new B.r("Nuclear fission is discovered",1938,"Hahn and Strassmann split uranium; Lise Meitner explained why. The finding led directly to both reactors and the atomic bomb.")
A.lyU=new B.r("Fermi runs the first controlled nuclear chain reaction",1942,"The Chicago Pile-1 reactor was built under a stadium's stands. It proved humans could release and control nuclear energy.")
A.lyV=new B.r("The Trinity test detonates the first atomic bomb",1945,"In the New Mexico desert the nuclear age began with one flash. Oppenheimer later recalled the line 'now I am become death'.")
A.lxs=new B.r("Bell Labs invents the transistor",1947,"This tiny switch replaced bulky vacuum tubes in electronics. Billions of them now sit inside every phone and computer.")
A.lCK=new B.r("Watson and Crick reveal the structure of DNA",1953,"The double helix explained how life copies its own instructions. Rosalind Franklin's X-ray images were key to the discovery.")
A.lxS=new B.r("Jonas Salk's polio vaccine is proven effective",1955,"A disease that paralysed thousands of children was finally beaten. Salk refused to patent it, saying it belonged to all.")
A.lx7=new B.r("Sputnik 1 becomes the first artificial satellite",1957,"The Soviet Union's beach-ball-sized sphere beeped from orbit. Its launch kicked off the space race almost overnight.")
A.lzI=new B.r("Explorer 1 launches and NASA is born",1958,"America's first satellite discovered the Van Allen radiation belts. NASA was created the same year to lead the effort.")
A.lxX=new B.r("Yuri Gagarin becomes the first human in space",1961,"He orbited Earth once in 108 minutes aboard Vostok 1. At 27 he returned a global hero of the space age.")
A.lvj=new B.r("Penzias and Wilson detect the cosmic microwave background",1965,"A faint hiss in their antenna turned out to be the Big Bang's afterglow. It became the strongest evidence for the theory.")
A.lz2=new B.r("Christiaan Barnard performs the first heart transplant",1967,"In Cape Town he moved a human heart into a living patient. The operation transformed the future of organ surgery.")
A.luy=new B.r("Apollo 11 lands on the Moon",1969,"Neil Armstrong touched down with less than 30 seconds of landing fuel to spare. 600 million people watched live.")
A.lxe=new B.r("The first CT scan images a human patient",1971,"Godfrey Hounsfield's machine let doctors see inside the body in slices. It revolutionised diagnosis without surgery.")
A.lzB=new B.r("Viking 1 makes the first successful Mars landing",1976,"NASA's lander sent back the first clear pictures from the Martian surface and searched its soil for signs of life.")
A.lvK=new B.r("Louise Brown, the first IVF baby, is born",1978,"The first child conceived outside the body arrived in England. In-vitro fertilisation has since led to millions of births.")
A.lAm=new B.r("The Space Shuttle Columbia makes its first flight",1981,"It was the first reusable spacecraft, landing like a plane. The shuttle fleet would fly for the next three decades.")
A.lD1=new B.r("Scientists identify HIV as the cause of AIDS",1983,"French researchers isolated the virus behind the epidemic. The discovery paved the way for tests and later treatments.")
A.lBB=new B.r("Supernova 1987A explodes into view",1987,"It was the closest supernova seen since the invention of the telescope. Detectors even caught neutrinos from the blast.")
A.lvQ=new B.r("The Hubble Space Telescope is launched",1990,"Above the blurring atmosphere it delivered our sharpest views of the cosmos, from newborn stars to the deep early universe.")
A.lxJ=new B.r("The first exoplanet around a Sun-like star is found",1995,"Mayor and Queloz spotted 51 Pegasi b, a world orbiting another star. Thousands more planets have since been discovered.")
A.lBo=new B.r("Dolly the sheep becomes the first cloned mammal",1996,"Scottish scientists grew her from a single adult cell. She proved a specialised cell could rebuild a whole animal.")
A.luc=new B.r("Assembly of the International Space Station begins",1998,"The first modules linked up in orbit to start the largest structure ever built in space. It has hosted crews ever since.")
A.lzo=new B.r("The Human Genome Project is completed",2003,"Scientists finished mapping all three billion letters of human DNA. It became a foundation for modern medicine and biology.")
A.lyL=new B.r("ESA's Huygens probe lands on Saturn's moon Titan",2005,"Europe's probe made the first landing in the outer Solar System. It revealed a frozen world with rivers and lakes of methane.")
A.lBy=new B.r("Pluto is reclassified as a dwarf planet",2006,"Astronomers redefined what counts as a planet, and Pluto lost its title. The decision remains fiercely debated today.")
A.lys=new B.r("India's Chandrayaan-1 finds water on the Moon",2008,"ISRO's first lunar mission helped confirm water molecules in the Moon's soil, reshaping plans for future exploration.")
A.lzt=new B.r("Japan's Hayabusa returns the first asteroid sample",2010,"JAXA's probe brought back grains from asteroid Itokawa after a seven-year, troubled journey of billions of kilometres.")
A.lyZ=new B.r("The Higgs boson is discovered at CERN",2012,"The 'God particle' explained how other particles get their mass. It capped a search that had run for nearly fifty years.")
A.ly9=new B.r("Gravitational waves are detected for the first time",2016,"LIGO caught ripples in spacetime from two colliding black holes. Einstein had predicted them a full century earlier.")
A.lut=new B.r("The first image of a black hole is released",2019,"The Event Horizon Telescope linked dishes worldwide into one Earth-sized eye to photograph a black hole's fiery shadow.")
A.lzp=new B.r("The first mRNA vaccines are authorised",2020,"A new type of vaccine was rolled out against COVID-19 in record time. The technology had been quietly developed for decades.")
A.lAS=new B.r("The James Webb Space Telescope launches",2021,"The most powerful space telescope ever built unfolded like origami in space to peer back toward the first galaxies.")
A.lxZ=new B.r("India's Chandrayaan-3 lands near the lunar south pole",2023,"ISRO made India the first nation to touch down near the Moon's south pole, a region prized for its possible water ice.")
